  lineArray:
  - speaker: 0
    text: A good day. And the new strip cost me nothing but one sawit.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
  - speaker: 0
    text: Two weeks of harvests barely moved the debt. Sixteen more days won't do it either.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
  - speaker: 0
    text: The field is still too small.
    playerEmote: 10
